          "selection",
          "coverages"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "The exact stored CaseAuthoritySelection and every CaseAuthorityCoverage row it pinned for evaluation in this Case, coverages in ascending coverageId order. A historical record only: never a G1 decision, current authority, signer eligibility, G7 or readiness."
